description:
Add shared wizard-shell behavior for navigation and draft persistence.

Every step should support, where applicable:
- ? for help;
- list;
- search <term>;
- back;
- review;
- set <field>;
- save;
- quit.

Drafts should be saveable and resumable, likely under .eshyra/drafts/characters/<draft-id>.json or the project-standard local state directory.

Acceptance criteria
- review shows current draft, completed fields, missing required choices, and derived values available so far.
- save writes a resumable draft.
- quit offers to save when unsaved changes exist.
- resume restores the draft without losing state.
- back and set <field> allow corrections without restarting.
- Tests cover save/resume and at least one correction flow.
